## Mandatory Design System Requirements

### 0. CRITICAL: Dark Theme — No White Backgrounds

The entire site uses a dark theme. **Never use `bg-white` for page backgrounds or cards.** Never use `shadow-sm`, `shadow-md`, or `shadow-lg`.

**`text-primary` is BLACK (#000000) — invisible on dark backgrounds. Always use `text-white` for headings.**

### 1. Colors - Dark Theme Tokens

**Page/Card backgrounds:**
```tsx
// Page background (body is black)
<div className="min-h-screen">Content</div>

// Card background (dark gradient + border)
<div
  className="rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-white/[0.15]"
  style={{background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #111 0%, #0A0A0A 40%, #080808 100%)'}}
>
  Card content
</div>

// Subtle elevated area
<div className="bg-white/[0.05]">Elevated section</div>
```

**Text colors:**
```tsx
<h1 className="text-white">Heading</h1>
<p className="text-white/50">Body text</p>
<span className="text-accent">Accent text</span>
<p className="text-white/40">Secondary/helper text</p>
```

**Borders:**
```tsx
<div className="border-white/[0.08]">Standard border</div>
<div className="hover:border-white/[0.15]">Hover border</div>
```

**Inputs:**
```tsx
<input className="bg-white/[0.05] text-white placeholder:text-white/25 focus:bg-white/[0.08]" />
```

**FORBIDDEN:**
```tsx
<div className="bg-white">NEVER for page/card backgrounds</div>
<div className="shadow-sm">NEVER use shadows</div>
<div className="text-primary">INVISIBLE on dark backgrounds</div>
<div className="border-black/5">Wrong — use border-white/[0.08]</div>
<div className="bg-surface">Wrong — use bg-white/[0.05]</div>
```

### 2. Typography - Use Typography Scale Only

**REQUIRED:**
```tsx
// Hero headlines (48px)
<h1 className="font-display text-hero text-white">Hero</h1>

// Page titles (36px)
<h1 className="font-display text-page-title text-white">Page Title</h1>

// Section headings (28px)
<h2 className="font-display text-section text-white">Section</h2>

// Subsections (20px)
<h3 className="font-display text-subsection text-white">Subsection</h3>

// Body text
<p className="text-body-lg text-white/50">Large body</p>
<p className="text-body text-white/50">Standard body</p>
<span className="text-body-sm text-white/40">Small text</span>
<span className="text-caption text-accent">Caption</span>
```

### 3. Eyebrow Text Pattern - Always Use

**REQUIRED for section headers:**
```tsx
<span className="inline-block text-accent text-caption uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-semibold mb-4">
  Category Label
</span>
```

### 4. Section Headers - Centered Pattern

**REQUIRED for section introductions:**
```tsx
<div className="text-center mb-16">
  <span className="inline-block text-accent text-caption uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-semibold mb-4">
    Eyebrow
  </span>
  <h2 className="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
    Section Title
  </h2>
  <p className="text-body-lg text-white/50 max-w-[42rem] mx-auto">
    Description text centered and constrained.
  </p>
</div>
```

### 5. Spacing - Use 8px System

**REQUIRED:**
```tsx
<section className="py-20 md:py-28">Content</section>
<div className="space-y-6">Stacked elements</div>
<div className="gap-8 lg:gap-12">Grid gaps</div>
```

### 6. Cards - Dark Gradient Pattern

**REQUIRED:**
```tsx
<div
  className="rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] hover:border-white/[0.15] transition-colors"
  style={{background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #111 0%, #0A0A0A 40%, #080808 100%)'}}
>
  <div className="h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/[0.08] to-transparent" />
  <div className="p-6">
    <h3 className="text-white font-bold">Title</h3>
    <p className="text-white/50">Body</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

### 7. Buttons on Dark Backgrounds

**REQUIRED:**
```tsx
<Button variant="primary" className="!bg-accent !text-white !border-accent hover:!bg-accent/90">
  Primary CTA
</Button>
<Button variant="secondary" className="!border-white/30 !text-white hover:!bg-white/10">
  Secondary CTA
</Button>
```

### 8. Focus States - All Interactive Elements

**REQUIRED:**
```tsx
<button className="focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:ring-offset-2">
  Button
</button>
```

### 9. Touch Targets - Minimum 44px

**REQUIRED:**
```tsx
<button className="min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px]">Tap target</button>
```

---

## Pre-Commit Checklist

Before committing any UI changes, verify:

- [ ] **Colors**: No `bg-white` cards, no `text-primary` headings, no shadows
- [ ] **Cards**: Use dark gradient + `border-white/[0.08]`
- [ ] **Typography**: All text uses typography scale
- [ ] **Headings**: Use `text-white` (not `text-primary`)
- [ ] **Body text**: Use `text-white/50` (not `text-secondary`)
- [ ] **Borders**: Use `border-white/[0.08]` (not `border-black/*`)
- [ ] **Inputs**: Use `bg-white/[0.05]` (not `bg-surface` or `bg-white`)
- [ ] **Spacing**: All spacing uses 8px system
- [ ] **Eyebrows**: Section headers have eyebrow text
- [ ] **Focus States**: All interactive elements focusable
- [ ] **Touch Targets**: Minimum 44x44px
- [ ] **Responsive**: Tested at mobile, tablet, desktop

---

## Error Patterns - Must Fix

**"White background on card"**
```tsx
// WRONG
<div className="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-black/5">

// FIX
<div className="rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08]"
  style={{background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #111 0%, #0A0A0A 40%, #080808 100%)'}}>
```

**"Invisible heading text"**
```tsx
// WRONG — text-primary is black, invisible on dark bg
<h2 className="text-primary">Heading</h2>

// FIX
<h2 className="text-white">Heading</h2>
```

**"Light theme border"**
```tsx
// WRONG
<div className="border-black/5">

// FIX
<div className="border-white/[0.08]">
```

---

## Summary

**Every UI change MUST:**
1. Read design system skill first
2. Use dark theme patterns (no white backgrounds, no shadows)
3. Use `text-white` for headings (never `text-primary`)
4. Use dark gradient cards with subtle borders
5. Follow section patterns (eyebrows, headers, layouts)
6. Meet accessibility requirements
7. Be responsive (mobile-first)
8. Pass pre-commit checklist
